Package: assessor
Title: Assessment Tools for Regression Models with Discrete and Semicontinuous Outcomes
Version: 1.3.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("Lu", "Yang", email="luyang@umn.edu", role = "aut"),
    person("Jeonghwan", "Lee", email="lee03938@umn.edu", role=c("cre", "aut")))
Description: Provides assessment tools for regression models with discrete and
    semicontinuous outcomes. The implemented methods are described in
    Yang (2021) <doi:10.1080/10618600.2021.1910042>,
    Yang (2024) <doi:10.1080/10618600.2024.2303336>,
    Yang (2024) <doi:10.1093/biomtc/ujae007>, and
    Yang et al. (2026) <doi:10.1002/cjs.70046>. It calculates double probability integral transform (DPIT) residuals and constructs QQ plots, ordered curves, quasi-empirical residual distribution functions, and formal goodness-of-fit tests.
